{
  "name": "pointer-target-drag-bound",
  "description": "Held-button binding: a press retargeted onto a moved slider binds its target and offset until release, so drag motions and the release move by the same offset and carry the press's target even when they name another node; after the release a targeted hover lands on its own node. A touch press binds per touch the same way (Godot's emulated mouse follows the placed touch and carries no meta).",
